      "value": "Related post: \"Suggest to use Microsoft YaHei UI for menu type font character rather than NotoSans\" (  https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/suggest-to-use-microsoft-yahei-ui-for-menu-type-font-character-rather-than-notos ) To improve the readability, Chinese users want to change the font and adjust the text size.",
